repository-code: 'https://github.com/koenAStam/beFAIR'
url: 'https://github.com/koenAStam/beFAIR'
abstract: >-
  beFAIR is an R package that provides an ETL
  (Extract-Transform-Load) framework for clinical research
  platforms. It creates and manages structured 'FAIRground'
  project directories, enforces codebook-driven data schemas
  in a SQL database, and automates the drafting, running,
  and tracking of ETL scripts. Designed to harmonize data
  across clinical studies using standardized codebooks,
  beFAIR supports reproducible data ingestion and promotes
  FAIR (Findable, Accessible, Interoperable, Reusable) data
  practices.
keywords:
  - R package
  - ETL
